        "ASM loc_12098 should use the pre-increment `d3` frame index, wrap `d3` with `andi.w #3`, DMA `off_1220E[d4] + 2` to VRAM `$F600`, and reload `$44(a5)` with `#9` once the countdown reaches zero"
