    // sub_1C204, whose `addi.w #$10,($FFFFF876).w` / `cmpi.w #$100` fade loop
    // delays the later `loc_1B9B6` DBF countdown. Once loc_1B9B6 finally
    // flips `Game_Mode=$24`, the carried `Camera_Y_pos=4` still survives into
    // intro sequence 5.
